# Play test of Pelican Spit (CIPlay pelican_spit, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: out along the spit and the landing
# stage, the crate on its head, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Pelican Spit
offset 0 0
expect animals Stingray 2
wait 3
walk 10 -4 to 20 -4 h=1 below=3
walk 22 -4 to 28 -4 to 34 -4 h=1.5 below=4
expect stand 30 -3.25 h=1.5 below=4
open Crate on the landing stage
dig
